@startuml sequence-og-pipeline
title Open Graph card pipeline: og:build and build-time check

actor Maintainer
participant "scripts/build-og.mjs" as Script
participant "next dev\nOG_GENERATE=1" as Dev
participant "opengraph-image.tsx" as Route
participant "lib/og-card.tsx" as Card
participant "sharp" as Sharp
database "public/og" as Out

== npm run og:build ==
Maintainer -> Script : npm run og:build
Script -> Dev : spawn on port 4021
Script -> Dev : GET /sitemap.xml and extra noindex routes
loop for each route
  Script -> Dev : GET opengraph-image
  Dev -> Route : default export Image()
  Route -> Card : renderOgCard(key, eyebrow, title)
  Card --> Dev : ImageResponse (Satori PNG) with x-og-* headers
  Dev --> Script : PNG
  Script -> Sharp : JPEG, mozjpeg, quality 82
  Sharp --> Script : JPEG bytes
  Script -> Script : check 200 KB ceiling
  Script -> Out : write key.jpg
end
Script -> Out : write manifest.json, delete cards of removed routes

== npm run build ==
Maintainer -> Route : next build prerenders each card route
Route -> Card : renderOgCard(key, eyebrow, title)
Card -> Out : read manifest.json entry
alt entry missing or title differs
  Card --> Maintainer : throw, build fails with the og:build command
else entry matches
  Card -> Out : read key.jpg
  Card --> Route : Response image/jpeg, immutable cache header
end

@enduml
